Error [E2307]: `label` cannot be used directly here without an owning copy
  --> copies_explicit_view_field.jet:12:24
    |
 12 |     user :: User{name: label}
    |                        ^^^^^
 Why: `label` is a zero-copy view into `text` (`.trim()`/`.after()`/`.before()`); this destination needs an owned `String`, and `copies: .Explicit` keeps the implicit materialization disabled
 Fix: Write `~label` first, or remove `copies: .Explicit` to use the default owning copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2307

